---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="页面未找到（404）｜机场优惠"
  description="抱歉，您访问的页面不存在或已变更地址。请使用全站搜索或返回机场优惠首页。"
  canonicalPath="/404/"
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="bg-band-hero py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-200 text-[#102343] text-xs font-bold mb-4">
        HTTP 404
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#102343] mb-4">
        抱歉，找不到该页面
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        您访问的链接可能已调整或输入有误。可以通过下方按钮返回首页、浏览优惠码中心或直接检索机场品牌。
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-[#102343] text-white text-sm font-semibold min-h-[44px] inline-flex items-center"
        >
          返回首页
        </a>
        <a
          href="/coupons/"
          class="px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 text-white text-sm font-semibold min-h-[44px] inline-flex items-center"
        >
          优惠码中心
        </a>
        <a
          href="/search/"
          class="px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 text-[#102343] text-sm font-semibold min-h-[44px] inline-flex items-center"
        >
          全站搜索
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
